% clv-additions.bib
% New, citation-verified references for the Customer Lifetime Value chapter
% (13-clv.qmd). Every DOI below was confirmed against the Crossref
% version-of-record record (title, container-title, year, first-author family
% name) per the editorial research ledger in
% .editorial/research/clv-advances.md. No DOI was invented.
%
% MAINTAINER NOTE: this file must be registered under `bibliography:` in
% _quarto.yml for the @cites below to resolve. That edit is intentionally left
% to the maintainer (the build config was not modified by the chapter rewrite).
%
% This file also supplies CORRECTED keys for three references the chapter
% previously miscited:
%   - paretonbd1987      replaces the misuse of `schmittlein1982`
%                        (that key is Schmittlein & Mahajan 1982, a diffusion
%                        paper, not the Pareto/NBD origin).
%   - kumarCRV2010       replaces the misuse of `kumar_2007` for the formal
%                        customer-referral-value model (that key is an HBR
%                        word-of-mouth piece).
%   - rustLemonZeithaml2004 replaces the misuse of `rust2002customer` for
%                        customer equity (that key is an internet-privacy paper).
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

